#: source/installation/obtaining-source.md:1
msgid "Obtaining the Source"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/obtaining-source.md:3
msgid ""
"The most recent sources of Nix can be obtained from its [Git repository]"
"(https://github.com/NixOS/nix). For example, the following command will "
"check out the latest revision into a directory called `nix`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/obtaining-source.md:8
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ git clone https://github.com/NixOS/nix\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/obtaining-source.md:12
msgid ""
"Likewise, specific releases can be obtained from the [tags](https://"
"github.com/NixOS/nix/tags) of the repository."
msgstr ""
